  "spoken_summary": "Karoline Leavitt delivers a message from President Trump, demanding an end to \"resistance and chaos\" in Minnesota. She outlines Trump's \"clear and simple path to restoring law and order,\" which includes three main points for Governor Walz, Mayor Frey, and other Democratic leaders: 1) Turn over all incarcerated \"criminal illegal aliens\" to federal authorities for deportation. 2) Have state and local law enforcement turn over all arrested \"illegal aliens.\" 3) Have local police assist federal law enforcement in apprehending and detaining \"illegal aliens wanted for crimes.\" She claims these are \"common sense cooperative measures\" already implemented in other states. She concludes by stating that Trump is also calling on Congress to pass legislation ending sanctuary cities, arguing that cities should be sanctuaries for \"law-abiding citizens only.\"",
